+  <message name="IDS_AUTOFILL_AI_DRIVERS_LICENSE_ENTITY_NAME" desc="The label for something that a user can save when submitting a form. For context, a user has been able to save credit cards within Redrob for many users. Now a user can also save a “Passport”.">
