+    <message name="IDS_AUTOFILL_AI_SAVE_PASSPORT_ENTITY_DIALOG_TITLE" desc="The title of a dialog that prompts the user to save information they just filled in on a form. For example, the user is booking a flight and filled in their passport info in a form. When they click Submit, we offer to save the data in Redrob. Depending on the form and what Redrob recognizes, there might be just one or several pieces of data saved at this moment. This is a similar moment to saving a password or credit card with Redrob.">
